                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0e74acb0-fcda-3041-811a-c2b889301bb9",
                        "entry_id": "203ea741-f44a-3946-ac99-a8230bb9b076",
                        "glosses": [
                            "mehr oder weniger stimmiges Größenverhältnis zwischen Teilen eines Gegenstandes"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbd373f0-e3f2-4e37-9aae-397f53180e46",
                                "sense_id": "0e74acb0-fcda-3041-811a-c2b889301bb9",
                                "text": "Aktstudien helfen dabei, ein Gefühl für die richtigen Proportionen zu bekommen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7039aab2-ed35-435a-a4b3-c2f3bcd280f6",
                                "sense_id": "0e74acb0-fcda-3041-811a-c2b889301bb9",
                                "text": "Bei dieser Zeichnung stimmen die Proportionen nicht."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d56db87c-7625-31bc-ae60-3cd17c497661",
                        "entry_id": "203ea741-f44a-3946-ac99-a8230bb9b076",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Verhältnisgleichung"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e09fbc4-e600-4dac-a517-39bd77f369c2",
                                "sense_id": "d56db87c-7625-31bc-ae60-3cd17c497661",
                                "text": "Eine Proportion kann eine Bestimmungsgleichung sein."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9841f22c-fabb-47c5-8a35-69f4d742ebd0",
                        "source_entry_id": "203ea741-f44a-3946-ac99-a8230bb9b076",
                        "source_sense_id": "0e74acb0-fcda-3041-811a-c2b889301bb9",
                        "source_sense_description": "mehr oder weniger stimmiges Größenverhältnis zwischen Teilen eines Gegenstandes",
                        "target_lang_word": "proportion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "proportion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d17bf76c-f8a0-38d3-bc9f-2dbdee090cd4",
                                        "entry_id": "531e65a7-6856-3d29-88c8-ef841566fd30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A quantity of something that is part of the whole amount or number."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dce10b91-3f8c-43a4-8c8d-3166f069c3f3",
                                                "sense_id": "d17bf76c-f8a0-38d3-bc9f-2dbdee090cd4",
                                                "text": "“I don't mean all of your friends—only a small proportion—which, however, connects your circle with that deadly, idle, brainless bunch—the insolent chatterers at the opera, the gorged dowagers, the worn-out, passionless men, the enervated matrons of the summer capital,[…]!”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10877fcc-6a87-36cb-bd5f-fda3d0f7571d",
                                        "entry_id": "531e65a7-6856-3d29-88c8-ef841566fd30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Harmonious relation of parts to each other or to the whole."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d267ad2e-3c97-3e3b-bee3-df0d6094bc06",
                                        "entry_id": "531e65a7-6856-3d29-88c8-ef841566fd30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Proper or equal share."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4704aa85-3c39-4da8-af37-52ae8e74acae",
                                                "sense_id": "d267ad2e-3c97-3e3b-bee3-df0d6094bc06",
                                                "text": "Let the women[…]do the same things in their proportions and capacities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac7c77fe-57cd-3e18-a02a-e8a7f68508e2",
                                        "entry_id": "531e65a7-6856-3d29-88c8-ef841566fd30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The relation of one part to another or to the whole with respect to magnitude, quantity, or degree."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c99d39f-ea8a-455c-8620-482b2c3cc905",
                                                "sense_id": "ac7c77fe-57cd-3e18-a02a-e8a7f68508e2",
                                                "text": "the proportion of the parts of a building, or of the body"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0791f75f-d313-4303-bbb5-05bd34f34f78",
                                                "sense_id": "ac7c77fe-57cd-3e18-a02a-e8a7f68508e2",
                                                "text": "The image of Christ made in Pilate's time after his own proportion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb209ed9-0b45-45d1-add5-a1876a948778",
                                                "sense_id": "ac7c77fe-57cd-3e18-a02a-e8a7f68508e2",
                                                "text": "Formed in the best proportions of her sex."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92d06fe1-5a3f-3d53-9eed-78d47e450a5b",
                                        "entry_id": "531e65a7-6856-3d29-88c8-ef841566fd30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A statement of equality between two ratios."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac2a2406-ea51-380e-a588-64e5708c18d0",
                                        "entry_id": "531e65a7-6856-3d29-88c8-ef841566fd30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The \\\"rule of three\\\", in which three terms are given to find a fourth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d05239ec-ebd9-37a1-b7d8-fc9928318c30",
                                        "entry_id": "531e65a7-6856-3d29-88c8-ef841566fd30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Size."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "in-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8ddf04b-143f-46d2-a305-382ac8964446",
                                                "sense_id": "d05239ec-ebd9-37a1-b7d8-fc9928318c30",
                                                "text": "The humor of my proposition appealed more strongly to Miss Trevor than I had looked for, and from that time forward she became her old self again;[…]. Now she had come to look upon the matter in its true proportions, and her anticipation of a possible chance of teaching him a lesson was a pleasure to behold."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "676a0bd3-2a9f-4645-954e-8638e27eb8fb",
                                                "sense_id": "d05239ec-ebd9-37a1-b7d8-fc9928318c30",
                                                "text": "What other television show would feature a gorgeously designed sequence where a horrifically mutated Pierre and Marie Curie, their bodies swollen to Godzilla-like proportions from prolonged exposure to the radiation that would eventually kill them, destroy an Asian city with their bare hands like vengeance-crazed monster-Gods?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "proportion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1eb9968c-bc7a-368f-afa8-4cca27db0576",
                                        "entry_id": "079c98dd-03f5-3f3b-8ad4-4e390c6d2cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To divide into proper shares; to apportion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "995b0c71-271e-4876-9428-403bc71ff4e6",
                                                "sense_id": "1eb9968c-bc7a-368f-afa8-4cca27db0576",
                                                "text": "In order to proportion the braking force to the weight carried by a wheel - a matter of special importance in the braking of wagons - variable leverage systems are now being introduced in which the end of one axle spring is linked to a control spring in the change-over valve, so automatically varying the leverage exerted by the brake-rod according to whether the wagon is full or empty."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0d34cc3-0b0c-35a5-9212-848cb896ad9c",
                                        "entry_id": "079c98dd-03f5-3f3b-8ad4-4e390c6d2cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To form symmetrically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57b0b512-720b-3936-b45f-6e0ee3a5d55e",
                                        "entry_id": "079c98dd-03f5-3f3b-8ad4-4e390c6d2cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To set or render in proportion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9886c1ac-aff0-3359-a002-c5a2af4cd249",
                                        "entry_id": "079c98dd-03f5-3f3b-8ad4-4e390c6d2cab",
